flowchart TD
    Idea["选定综合项目"]
    Outline["勾勒架构：<br/>- BPF 程序<br/>- 映射 + 大小<br/>- 用户空间消费者<br/>- 验证器风险点"]

    Build["构建最小版本"]
    Verify{"验证器拒绝？"}
    Read["阅读验证器日志<br/>定位类型/生命周期问题"]
    Fix["调整代码"]

    Test["在测试负载上运行"]
    Measure["测量：<br/>吞吐量、<br/>开销、<br/>正确性"]
    OK{"可接受？"}

    Polish["打磨：<br/>丢弃计数器、<br/>README、<br/>构建说明"]
    Done(["综合项目完成"])

    Idea --> Outline --> Build --> Verify
    Verify -->|是| Read --> Fix --> Build
    Verify -->|否，接受| Test --> Measure --> OK
    OK -->|否| Read
    OK -->|是| Polish --> Done

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef hot fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    class Done ok
    class Verify,OK hot
    class Read,Fix bad
